    'terms.desc' => 'Consult the general terms and conditions governing the access to and use of the Pit o Cuixa platform.',

    // ── Section 0 ────────
    'terms.intro.title' => 'Introduction',
    'terms.intro.paragraph1' => 'These general terms of use and legal information (hereinafter, the "General Terms") apply to the website of LAST SYSTEMS, S.L. (hereinafter, "Last"), whose domain is shop.last.app, as well as to the corresponding mobile application, and to all websites related to or linked from www.last.app by Last. The website is owned by Last. By using the website, you indicate your agreement with these terms of use. If you do not agree, we kindly ask you to refrain from using it.',
    'terms.intro.paragraph2' => 'Through these General Terms, Last provides users (hereinafter, the "User" or "Users") with access to Last\'s website and mobile application (hereinafter, collectively, the "Platform").',
    'terms.intro.paragraph3' => 'In compliance with the applicable legal framework, the following identification details of the website owner are provided:',
    'terms.intro.company_name' => 'Company Name: LAST SYSTEMS, S.L.',
    'terms.intro.address' => 'Registered Office: C/ Maracaibo No. 8, 08030, Barcelona, Spain',
    'terms.intro.registry' => 'Registration details in the Barcelona Commercial Registry: Protocol 2019/1100, Volume: 46867, Page: 83, Sheet: 533596, Entry: 1. Tax Identification Number (NIF): B67417758',
    'terms.intro.paragraph4' => 'In addition, the following identification details of the payment processors shall apply as follows:',

    // ── Section 1 ────────
    'terms.object.title' => 'Purpose',
    'terms.object.paragraph1' => 'Last is a technology company whose main activity is the development and management of a technological platform through which, by means of a mobile application or a website (hereinafter, the "APP"), it enables certain local stores in various cities across different territories to offer or list their products and/or services. Where requested by APP users and customers of those local stores through the APP, Last also acts, on an ancillary basis, as an intermediary in the immediate delivery of products.',
    'terms.object.paragraph2' => 'Accordingly, Last has developed a Platform through which different businesses, with which Last may maintain a commercial agreement for the use of the Platform, offer and/or may list a range of products and services. The Customer has the possibility of requesting the purchase and/or collection of products and services from these businesses in person, by granting a mandate to a third party when placing an order through the Platform. In such cases, Last acts solely as an intermediary and, therefore, cannot and does not assume any responsibility for the quality of the products or the proper provision of the services offered directly by the businesses or by such third parties.',
    'terms.object.paragraph3' => 'Likewise, Last is an intermediary Platform for the electronic contracting of on-demand delivery services. Its purpose is to enable those who request home delivery from local businesses (hereinafter, "Customers") to have errands carried out by delegating them to third parties willing to voluntarily perform the mandate entrusted to them by the Customers (hereinafter, "Agents").',
    'terms.object.paragraph4' => 'The Agents are therefore a network of independent professionals who collaborate with third-party companies engaged by the Customer whenever they are interested in providing their services. Consequently, Last cannot assume responsibility for delivery times, as these will depend on the proper performance of the local stores in preparing the orders, the Agents themselves, as well as the information provided by users when placing the order or their availability and response at the time of delivery. For these purposes, the delivery times indicated on the Website are merely indicative.',
    'terms.object.paragraph5' => 'Throughout these General Terms of Use, Customers and Agents shall collectively be referred to as Users of the Platform.',

    // ── Section 2 ────────
    'terms.terms_of_use.title' => 'Terms of Use',
    'terms.terms_of_use.paragraph1' => 'Access to the Platform and the voluntary creation of a User profile imply the User’s knowledge and express, unequivocal acceptance of these General Terms of Use and Contracting, as well as the Privacy Policy and the Cookies Policy.',

    // ── Section 3 ────────
    'terms.customer_access.title' => 'Customer Access and Registration',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph1' => 'In order to become a Customer of the Platform, the following requirements must be met:',
    'terms.customer_access.requirement1' => 'Be at least 18 years of age.',
    'terms.customer_access.requirement2' => 'Truthfully complete the mandatory fields of the registration form, which require personal data such as username, email address, telephone number and bank card details.',
    'terms.customer_access.requirement3' => 'Accept these Terms of Use and Contracting.',
    'terms.customer_access.requirement4' => 'Accept the Privacy and Data Protection Policy.',
    'terms.customer_access.requirement5' => 'Accept the Cookies Policy.',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph2' => 'The User guarantees that all information relating to their identity and legal capacity provided to Last through the Platform registration forms is true, accurate and complete. The User also undertakes to keep such information up to date.',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph3' => 'If the User provides any false, inaccurate or incomplete information, or if Last has reasonable grounds to doubt its truthfulness, accuracy or completeness, Last may deny the User present or future access to and use of the Platform or any of its content and/or services.',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph4' => 'When registering on the Platform, the User shall choose a username and password. Both the username and password are strictly confidential, personal and non-transferable. Last recommends not using the same login credentials as those used on other platforms in order to increase account security. If the User uses the same login credentials as on other platforms, Last cannot guarantee the security of the account nor ensure that the User is the only person accessing their profile.',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph5' => 'The User undertakes not to disclose their account credentials or make them available to third parties. The User shall be solely responsible for any use of such credentials or of the Platform services by third parties, including any statements and/or content published on the Platform, or any other actions carried out using the username and/or password.',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph6' => 'The User shall remain the sole owner of the content published by them on the Platform. Furthermore, by registering on the Platform and accepting these Terms, the User grants Last, with respect to any content they may provide, a worldwide, irrevocable, transferable, royalty-free licence, with the right to sublicense, use, copy, modify, create derivative works, distribute, publicly communicate and otherwise exploit such content in any manner that Last deems appropriate, with or without further notice to the User and without the need to pay any compensation for such uses.',
    'terms.customer_access.paragraph7' => 'Last cannot guarantee the identity of registered Users and therefore shall not be responsible for the use of the identity of a registered User by unregistered third parties. Users undertake to immediately notify Last of the theft, disclosure or loss of their credentials through the communication channels made available by Last.',
    'terms.customer_access.profile_title' => '3.1 Profile',
    'terms.customer_access.profile_paragraph1' => 'In order to complete registration on the Platform, the User must provide certain information such as their username, email address, telephone number, bank card details, etc. Once registration has been completed, every User may access their profile to complete it, edit it and/or close their account as they see fit. Last does not store Users’ payment details, which shall be processed and stored by the payment service provider as described in these Terms and in the Privacy Policy.',
    'terms.customer_access.card_theft_title' => '3.2 Credit Card Theft or Loss',
    'terms.customer_access.card_theft_paragraph1' => 'As Last cannot guarantee the identity of registered Users, Users are required to notify Last whenever they become aware that the credit card linked to their Last profile has been stolen and/or is being fraudulently used by a third party. Although Last and its payment platform proactively protect Users through the appropriate security measures, if the User fails to notify Last of such theft, Last shall not be liable for any fraudulent use of the User’s account by third parties. In the event of theft, loss or suspected misuse of a credit card, Last encourages Users to report the matter to the relevant law enforcement authorities.',
    'terms.customer_access.card_theft_paragraph2' => 'Last undertakes to cooperate with the User and the competent authorities, where necessary, in order to provide reliable evidence of any improper charge. In the event of fraud, Last reserves the right to take any legal action it considers necessary where it has been harmed by the improper use of the Platform.',

    // ── Section 4 ────────
    'terms.service_operation.title' => 'Service Operation. Terms of the Mandate.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph1' => 'When a User registered as a Customer requires assistance with an errand, they must access Last’s web platform or the corresponding application and request the service through those electronic means. The basic errand service consists of collecting a product and subsequently delivering it, both at the addresses specified by the Customer, provided that they are located exclusively within Last’s operating area. Likewise, the Customer may request that the Agent purchase products in person on their behalf, collect them and deliver them to the specified addresses. Through the mandate, the Agent undertakes to purchase the products entrusted by the Customer in the Customer’s name and according to the instructions and specifications provided by the latter.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph2' => 'The Customer is solely responsible for correctly entering the delivery and collection addresses on the Platform and therefore releases Last and the Agent from any negligence or error in the collection or delivery of the order resulting from incorrect delivery or collection addresses. Consequently, the Customer shall bear any costs arising from incorrectly entering the delivery or collection addresses on the Platform.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph3' => 'The Customer shall provide all possible information regarding the service requested and, where applicable, the product they wish the Agent to purchase on their behalf from physical stores. To this end, the Customer may include any comments deemed useful in the "comments" section and, where applicable, may also share a photograph with the Agent to help identify the order. The Customer shall maintain constant communication with the Agent and may contact the Agent at any time to ensure that the mandate is carried out in accordance with the Customer’s own instructions.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph4' => 'To facilitate direct communication with the Agent and in the event of any issue during the processing of the order and/or to communicate any changes, Last provides Users with an internal chat that enables direct and immediate contact between the User and the Agent during the execution of the order. The chat will become inactive once the User has received the product or the order has been cancelled for any of the reasons provided for. If the User wishes to contact the Agent or Last after the completion of the order, they must use the contact form available on the Platform and contact customer support.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph5' => 'The Customer releases Last and the Agent from any negligence or error in the instructions provided for the purchase of products requested on their behalf from physical stores. Consequently, the Customer shall bear any costs arising from incorrectly entering the product details on the Platform (e.g. incorrect address, incorrect product).',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph6' => 'Where the price of the product and/or service is not shown on the Platform, and since the prices displayed on the Platform are indicative, the Customer may specify an estimated price. In such cases, the product or service may be purchased in person by the Agent according to the Customer’s estimate and never for an amount exceeding 30% above that estimate. If the price is higher, the Agent shall contact the Customer to inform them of the situation, and the Customer shall make the final decision as to whether or not to proceed with the in-store purchase. Solely for the purpose of assisting the User, Last may provide an approximate price estimate, although such estimate shall in no event be binding with regard to the final price payable by the User.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph7' => 'If the product and/or service is unavailable, the Agent shall contact the Customer to present the available alternatives. If the Customer does not agree with any of the options offered by the Agent and is therefore not interested in the alternative options, the Customer shall be subject to the cancellation policy set out in these General Terms of Use (Section Nine). If the Customer does not answer the calls, the Agent shall wait for 5 minutes before leaving.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph8' => 'Where the Customer is not present at the specified delivery location, the Agent shall keep the product for 24 hours, or for 5 minutes in the case of perishable products. The Customer shall also bear 100% of the cost of the basic errand service, as well as the price of the product if it has been purchased or contracted through the Agent on the Customer’s behalf, and shall be required to pay for a new service in order to receive the undelivered products. Under no circumstances shall the Agent be responsible for the deterioration or expiry of the product subject to the errand.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph9' => 'Once the errand has been completed, where the service involved the in-person purchase of a product, the Agent shall provide the Customer with the corresponding physical receipt for that product and/or send it by email. If the errand consists solely of delivering a product, the Agent shall deliver it to the Customer at the exact place and time specified by the Customer. This is without prejudice to the electronic receipt for the service that the Customer will receive at the email address associated with their account.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph10' => 'At that time, the User, being the recipient of the service identified in the order, or any third party authorised by the User, must confirm the mandate by signing on the Agent’s device. Last cannot verify the authenticity of the signature made by the User. If the User receives confirmation that the errand has been completed without personally confirming the mandate or without confirmation by an authorised recipient, the User must immediately notify Last so that the Platform may take the appropriate measures. Last reserves the right to verify any such notifications submitted by the User for confirmation and control purposes.',
    'terms.service_operation.paragraph11' => 'FOOD/PACKAGED PRODUCTS: Last recommends that when ordering food products through a mandate, the User requests information from the Agent and/or the restaurant or supplying establishment, through the means provided by the Platform, regarding the content and composition of the ordered food products.',

    // ── Section 5 ────────
    'terms.product_returns.title' => 'Product Returns',
    'terms.product_returns.paragraph1' => 'If the Customer wishes to return a product or submit a complaint regarding the provision of a service, notwithstanding the fact that Last, as an intermediary, may handle the process, the business where the purchase was made shall always be ultimately responsible. In the event that the purchase amount is refunded to the Customer, the business shall have the authority to determine the refund method (cash, credit card, store voucher, etc.), regardless of whether Last processes the refund on behalf of the local business. Therefore, the return of a product purchased by the Agent in execution of the mandate granted by the Customer shall in all cases be subject to the return policy of the relevant business.',
    'terms.product_returns.paragraph2' => 'Certain establishments may not have premises open to the public, meaning that the User may not be able to access them to process a return or complaint. In such cases, the User must contact Last’s customer support through the channels available on the Platform in order to receive the necessary assistance and support.',
    'terms.product_returns.paragraph3' => 'Notwithstanding the above, in the specific case of orders placed through the McDonald’s product menu available on the Platform, the Customer must contact Last directly.',
    'terms.product_returns.paragraph4' => 'If the User wishes to request the return of a product because it does not correspond to what was ordered through the Platform, the User must provide a photograph of the complete order together with a list of the incorrect or missing products, as well as any other evidence demonstrating that the delivered product does not match the requested one.',
    'terms.product_returns.paragraph5' => 'The Customer must inspect the products delivered by the Agent at the delivery address before signing and confirming the mandate. By signing, the Customer confirms and ratifies the mandate, the in-person purchase or the service carried out on their behalf. Furthermore, the Customer acknowledges that a third party may confirm the mandate on their behalf, for example, where the Customer is not present at the final delivery address or has designated a third party to receive and sign for the delivery. Accordingly, the Customer and/or such third party shall be responsible for verifying the adequacy of the service and, where applicable, gathering sufficient evidence to demonstrate otherwise.',
    'terms.product_returns.paragraph6' => 'In any event, it shall be atthe discretion ofthe business to determine whether a return is accepted in each case. Inthe event of a dispute, the Customer must notify Last throughthe channels made available by Last for this purpose.',

    // ── Section 6 ────────
    'terms.pricing.title' => 'Service Fees and Billing',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph1' => 'Registration and use of the Platform by Customers are completely free of charge.',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph2' => 'The use of the Platform by Agents and businesses may be subject to a fee depending on the destination country from which they wish to use the Platform to provide services.',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph3' => 'The Customer shall only pay for each service requested through the Platform in consideration of its use for ordering products, communicating through the Platform, and for the courier or errand services provided by third parties. In addition, where the service includes the purchase of a product, the User shall also pay the price of that product. By registering through the Platform and providing the required banking information, the User expressly authorises Last to charge the corresponding amounts for the requested services, including the price and delivery of the requested products.',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph4' => 'The total price of each service may include a variable percentage depending on the distance and time the Agent must travel, as well as, where applicable, the price set by each business in cases where the User requests the in-person purchase of a product or service. Last reserves the right to modify the price depending on the time slot and/or the distance at which the service is performed. Under these conditions, the Customer shall be entitled to know the approximate fee for the service before contracting it and completing the payment, except where the User has not specified the collection address. The delivery service fee may vary in the event of force majeure circumstances beyond Last’s control that result in an increase in the applicable fee.',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph5' => 'The fee may include tips for the Agent and/orthe local business, the amount of which shall depend solely onthe User’s discretion.',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph6' => 'Last reservesthe right to modify its prices at any time. Any changes shall take effect immediately upon publication. The User expressly authorises Last to send, by electronic means tothe email address provided during registration, them receipt forthe contracted services and/orthe invoices issued. Ifthe User requires an invoice, they must add their tax details tothe Platform before placingthe order.',
    'terms.pricing.paragraph7' => 'If the User cancels the service after the local business has confirmed that the order is being prepared and such confirmation has been communicated to the User, Last shall be entitled to charge the Customer the corresponding fee. Likewise, where the User has requested that the Agent purchase a product on their behalf, if the Customer cancels the order after the purchase has already been completed, the Customer shall bear the costs of the delivery services performed by the Agent, as well as the cost of the product. This is without prejudice to the Customer’s right to request a new service in order to return the purchased products or have them delivered to another address. In the case of non-perishable products, the User may exercise their right of withdrawal with the business that sold the products. If the User wishes to exercise this right through Last, they must contract a new service.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_title' => '6.1 Payment Platforms',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph1' => 'Payment for the products and/or services offered through the Platform, sold in person by the Restaurants and/or businesses and delivered to Customers at a later time, is received temporarily by Last, which then transfers it to the Restaurants and/or businesses with which it maintains a commercial agreement. The Restaurants and/or associated businesses authorise Last to accept payment on their behalf. Therefore, payment of the price of any product (e.g. food, drinks, gifts, etc.) correctly made to Last shall release the Customer from the obligation to pay that amount directly to the Restaurant and/or associated businesses.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph2' => 'Likewise, the Customer’s payment releases them from any obligation towards the Agent, and full payment by the Customer shall discharge any obligations that may exist towards Partners and/or Agents.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph3' => 'Payments for products and/or services made by Customers are received into Last’s accounts through an Electronic Money Institution. Electronic Money Institutions are authorised to provide regulated payment services in all territories in which Last operates and comply with the applicable regulations governing payment services for Platforms such as Last.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph4' => 'Through its contracted payment provider, and solely for the purpose of verifying the payment method provided, Last reserves the right, as an anti-fraud measure, to request a pre-authorisation for the amount corresponding to the products ordered through the Platform. Such pre-authorisation shall under no circumstances constitute full payment for the order, which shall only be completed once the products have been made available to the User or in the cases described in these Terms and Conditions.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph5' => 'In order to provide greater support to Users, Last shall act as their first point of contact and shall assume responsibility for payments made through the Platform. This responsibility includes refunds, returns, cancellations and the initial handling of disputes, without prejudice to any actions that Last may take with the local businesses, which remain the sole physical sellers of the products ordered by Users.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph6' => 'In accordance with the above, where a dispute arises, Last shall provide first-line support and, where appropriate, refund the User.',
    'terms.pricing.payment_platforms_paragraph7' => 'If the User experiences any issues with the processing of their order, they may contact Last’s customer support through the channels made available on the Platform.',

    // ── Section 7 ────────
    'terms.pricing_products.title' => 'Price of the Products and/or Services Listed on the Platform',
    'terms.pricing_products.paragraph1' => 'All prices displayed on the Platform include any taxes that may apply depending on the territory from which the User operates and shall, in all cases, be expressed in the currency in force in the territory from which the User operates.',
    'terms.pricing_products.paragraph2' => 'In accordance with Clause 6 above, the prices applicable to each service shall be those published on the Platform, subject to the particular conditions described therein, and shall be applied automatically during the final stage of the contracting process.',
    'terms.pricing_products.paragraph3' => 'However, the prices of products sold by restaurants and/or businesses displayed on Last’s Platform may be indicative. In any event, such prices correspond to the products sold by restaurants and/or businesses and are determined exclusively by them. The Customer may contact the Agent in order to confirm the final price of the requested products.',
    'terms.pricing_products.paragraph4' => 'The User acknowledges that, in all cases, the price of certain products may vary in real time depending on the establishment selling them and the available stock. For any information regarding the requested order, the User may contact Last.',
    'terms.pricing_products.paragraph5' => 'In accordance with the above, by requesting the purchase and delivery of products through the Platform, the Customer grants the Agent a mandate to purchase the products in person on the Customer’s behalf at the price set by the businesses. The Customer may remain in direct contact with the Agent both during the processing of the order and its delivery in order to indicate to the Agent which product is being requested.',

    // ── Section 8 ────────
    'terms.promo_codes.title' => 'Promotional Codes and/or Other Offers or Discounts',
    'terms.promo_codes.paragraph1' => 'Promotional codes and/or other offers or discounts made available through the Platform must be correctly entered in the application before placing the order; otherwise, they will not be valid for the User and cannot be redeemed.',
    'terms.promo_codes.paragraph2' => 'Whenever a cancellation is initiated by Last under the terms described in Section 9 below, the Customer shall retain the validity of the promotional code and/or other offers or discounts for future use. Where the cancellation is initiated by the User, the provisions of Section 9 below shall apply.',
    'terms.promo_codes.paragraph3' => 'Last reserves the right to cancel any promotional codes and/or other offers or discounts when it becomes aware of their fraudulent use (e.g. redeeming a promotional code when not the legitimate recipient, mass distribution of codes, selling discounts or promotional codes, etc.). Last also reserves the right to impose penalties on Users for the amount fraudulently obtained at the Company’s expense.',
    'terms.promo_codes.paragraph4' => 'Last accepts no liability if, due to force majeure or events beyond its control, or where justified by necessity, it is required to cancel, shorten, extend or modify the conditions of any promotion.',
    'terms.promo_codes.paragraph5' => 'In particular, Last accepts no liability if the website is unavailable at any time during promotional campaigns or if the automated promotional system malfunctions.',

    // ── Section 9 ────────
    'terms.withdrawal.title' => 'Right of Withdrawal and Order Cancellation',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph1' => 'Due to the nature of the service provided by Last, the User acknowledges that once an Agent has voluntarily accepted an order, the execution of the purchase mandate shall be deemed to have commenced and, therefore, the User may no longer be entitled to withdraw from the service request free of charge.',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph2' => 'Notwithstanding the above, cancellation costs may depend on the following factors:',
    'terms.withdrawal.condition1' => 'If the restaurant or establishment has accepted and started preparing the order, the cost of the products shall be charged. The restaurant’s acceptance shall be communicated to the User through the Platform and/or by email to the address registered by the User.',
    'terms.withdrawal.condition2' => 'If the User cancels the order after the Agent has accepted its processing, the User shall be charged the applicable cancellation fee. The Agent’s acceptance shall be communicated to the User through the Platform.',
    'terms.withdrawal.condition3' => 'If both the restaurant or establishment and the Agent have accepted the processing of the order, the User shall be charged both the price of the products and the cancellation fee.',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph3' => 'The User may consult the total cancellation costs for each order through the "Cancel" button available on the Platform. Before confirming the cancellation, the User will be informed of the charge that will apply according to the factors described above.',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph4' => 'Furthermore, if, at the time of cancellation, the Agent has already purchased the requested product or contracted the requested service, the User may instruct the Agent to return it. For this purpose, the User shall pay the full purchase price ofthe products, the delivery costs andthe cost ofthe return service. Ifthe Agent is able to returnthe product, the value ofthe product shall be refunded tothe User. However, as stated above,the User shall bearthe cost of boththe collection anddelivery services, as well asthe return service. In all cases, returns shall be subject tothe return policies ofthe relevant business. Accordingly,	the Customer acknowledges that, inthe case ofperishable products (e.g. food), returns may not be possible and, therefore, Last shall be entitled to charge boththe cost ofthe product already purchased bythe Agent underthe mandate andthe delivery service incurred.',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph5' => 'If the Customer has entered an incorrect delivery address for the products, they may provide a new address at any time, provided that it is located within the same city as the original order and that it is a city where Last offers its intermediary services. In such case, the Customer shall be requesting a new service and agrees to pay the corresponding charges for the new delivery. If the new address is located in a different city from the one originally specified, the delivery address may not be changed to another city, the order shall be cancelled, and the Customer shall bear the costs incurred as established in this clause.',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph6' => 'Last reserves the right to cancel an order without stating any specific reason. In the event of a cancellation initiated by Last, the User shall be entitled to a refund of the amount paid.',
    'terms.withdrawal.paragraph7' => 'Last provides official consumer complaint forms relating to the services offered by Last in the official languages of the countries in which Last operates. These complaint forms may be requested by the consumer through Last’s customer support service, and the option to access them will be sent automatically. The consumer must specify in the email the exact location from which the request is made, which must correspond to the place where the service was provided. In case of doubt, that location shall be deemed to be the place where the complaint must be submitted.',

    // ── Section 10 ────────
    'terms.alcohol.title' => '10. Purchase of Alcoholic Beverages',
    'terms.alcohol.paragraph1' => 'Users who place an order that includes the purchase and/or delivery of alcoholic beverages through the Platform must be of legal age, having reached 18 years of age. By placing an order that includes alcoholic beverages, the User confirms that they are at least 18 years old. Last reserves the right to refuse any order for the purchase and/or delivery of alcohol to any person who cannot prove that they are at least 18 years of age.',
    'terms.alcohol.paragraph2' => 'This clause shall apply equally to any other similar product and/or service restricted to persons of legal age under the applicable legislation and requested by a User through the Platform.',
    'terms.alcohol.paragraph3' => 'Likewise, in those cases and cities where the sale and/or delivery of alcoholic beverages is restricted during certain time periods, the User is responsible for placing orders only during the hours permitted under the applicable regulations. Last reserves the right to refuse any order for the purchase and/or delivery of alcohol outside the permitted hours.',

    // ── Section 11 ────────
    'terms.geolocation.title' => '11. Geolocation',
    'terms.geolocation.paragraph1' => 'Last may collect, use and share precise location data, including the real-time geographical location of the User’s computer or mobile device, provided that the User has given their consent. Such location data may be collected and used by Last to display to Users the pick-up location of a task and/or the destination location. In this regard, Users expressly consent to their geolocation data being shared with other Users and Providers in order to successfully carry out the requested task. Users may choose to disable geolocation on their devices as detailed in the Data Privacy Policy.',
    'terms.geolocation.paragraph2' => 'The User is responsible for correctly providing the collection and delivery addresses. In this regard, Last shall not be liable for any errors or omissions made by the User when providing such addresses.',

    // ── Section 12 ────────
    'terms.user_obligations.title' => '12. User Obligations',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph1' => 'Users are fully responsible for accessing and properly using their profile and all other content available on the Platform in accordance with the applicable laws, whether national or international, of the country from which they use the Platform, as well as with the principles of good faith, morality, good customs and public order. In particular, Users undertake to diligently comply with these General Terms of Use.',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph2' => 'Users are responsible for choosing and safeguarding individual, non-transferable usernames and passwords that are sufficiently secure, and for not using the same username and password as on other platforms, in order to protect their account against fraudulent use by third parties unrelated to the Platform.',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph3' => 'Users shall refrain from using their profile or any other content on the Platform for unlawful purposes or in any manner that infringes the rights or interests of third parties, or that may in any way damage, disable, impair or deteriorate the Platform, its content or its services. Likewise, Users are prohibited from preventing other Users from making normal use of and enjoying the Platform.',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph4' => 'Last shall not be considered an editorial publisher and expressly declares that it does not endorse any opinions expressed by Users on the Platform. The User issuing such opinions shall bear sole responsibility for any consequences arising therefrom.',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph5' => 'Any person who breaches these obligations shall be liable for any loss or damage caused. Last shall not be liable for any consequences, losses or damages arising from any unlawful access to or use of the Platform by third parties.',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph6' => 'In general, Users undertake, by way of example and without limitation, to:',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation1' => 'Not alter or modify, in whole or in part, the Platform, or circumvent, disable or otherwise manipulate its functions or services.',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation2' => 'Not infringe intellectual property rights, industrial property rights or the regulations governing the protection of personal data.',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation3' => 'Not use the Platform to insult, defame, intimidate, violate the image rights of, or harass other Users.',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation4' => 'Not access the email accounts of other Users.',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation5' => 'Not introduce computer viruses, corrupted files or any other software capable of causing damage to or alterations in the systems or content of Last or third parties.',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation6' => 'Not send mass and/or repetitive emails to multiple recipients, or send third-party email addresses without their consent.',
    'terms.user_obligations.obligation7' => 'Not carry out advertising or promotional activities for goods or services without the prior consent of Last.',
    'terms.user_obligations.paragraph7' => 'Any User may report another User if they believe that the latter is in breach of these General Terms of Use. Likewise, all Users may notify Last of any abuse or violation of these terms through the Contact Form. Last shall review such reports as soon as reasonably possible and shall adopt any measures it considers appropriate, reserving the right to remove and/or suspend any User from the Platform for breach of these General Terms of Use. Last also reserves the right to remove and/or suspend any message containing unlawful or offensive content without prior warning or subsequent notice.',

    // ── Section 13 ────────
    'terms.user_termination.title' => '13. User Account Termination',
    'terms.user_termination.paragraph1' => 'The User may terminate their account on the Platform by notifying Last via email through the Contact Form.',

    // ── Section 14 ────────
    'terms.last_liability.title' => '14. Last’s Liability',
    'terms.last_liability.paragraph1' => 'The User is responsible for having the services and equipment necessary to browse the Internet and access the Platform. In the event of any incident or difficulty accessing the Platform, the User may notify Last through the contact channels made available to them. Last shall analyse the incident and provide the User with instructions on how to resolve it as soon as possible.',
    'terms.last_liability.paragraph2' => 'Last neither controls nor is responsible for any content posted by Users through the Platform, the Users themselves being solely responsible for the legal compliance of such content.',
    'terms.last_liability.paragraph3' => 'Last shall not be liable for service interruptions, connection errors, lack of availability or deficiencies in Internet access services, nor for interruptions to the Internet network or any other cause beyond its control.',
    'terms.last_liability.paragraph4' => 'Last shall not be liable for any security errors that may occur or for any damage caused to the User’s computer system (hardware and software), or to the files or documents stored therein, as a result of:',
    'terms.last_liability.cause1' => 'The presence of a virus on the User’s computer system or mobile device used to access the Platform’s services and content.',
    'terms.last_liability.cause2' => 'A malfunction of the web browser.',
    'terms.last_liability.cause3' => 'The use of an outdated version of the web browser.',

    // ── Section 15 ────────
    'terms.content_liability.title' => '15. Liability for Content',
    'terms.content_liability.paragraph1' => 'Last is under no obligation to monitor, and does not monitor, the manner in which Users use the Platform. Consequently, Last does not guarantee that Users will use the Platform in accordance with these General Terms of Use, nor that they will use it diligently and/or prudently. Last is under no obligation to verify, and does not verify, the identity of Users or the accuracy, validity, completeness and/or authenticity of the information they provide.',
    'terms.content_liability.paragraph2' => 'Last shall not verify the products that may be collected or delivered through orders placed via the Platform. For this reason, both the User and the Agent release Last from any liability arising from the provision and/or transportation of products requiring specific permits or licences, as well as products prohibited under any applicable legislation. Should Last become aware that a User and/or an Agent is using the APP to transport prohibited products, Last may initiate an internal investigation to clarify the facts, take any necessary legal action and/or block the relevant User or Agent until the investigation has concluded. Among the measures available to Last is the disclosure of Users’ and Agents’ data and information to the competent authorities.',
    'terms.content_liability.paragraph3' => 'Last excludes any liability for damages of any kind that may arise from the unlawful use of the Platform by Users or from the inaccuracy, invalidity, incompleteness and/or lack of authenticity of the information that Users provide to other Users about themselves. This includes, in particular but not exclusively, any damages arising from the impersonation of a third party by a User in any communication carried out through the Platform. In particular, Last shall not be liable for the use of the application or for any orders placed by a third party using the User’s account.',
    'terms.content_liability.paragraph4' => 'Without prejudice to the foregoing, Last reserves the right to limit, in whole or in part, access to the Platform for certain Users, as well as to remove, suspend, block or delete specific types of content by means of appropriate technological tools, where it has actual knowledge that the activity or stored information is unlawful or infringes the rights or interests of a third party. In this regard, Last may implement the necessary filters to prevent unlawful or harmful content from being published through the service. The publication of content by Users through the Platform shall constitute the assignment to Last of all exploitation rights arising from the content made available on the Platform.',

    // ── Section 16 ────────
    'terms.no_warranty.title' => '16. Disclaimer of Warranty for Tasks and Payments',
    'terms.no_warranty.paragraph1' => 'Last makes no warranty regarding the authenticity, accuracy, timeliness, reliability, legality or non-infringement of third-party rights by Agents. In this regard, Users acknowledge that they understand that Last is a technology platform whose primary activity is intermediation, namely, connecting Customers and Agents. Accordingly, Last assumes no liability arising from the information provided by Agents or for any damages or losses that may result from a breach of these General Terms of Use. Once an order is placed through the APP and accepted by the Agent, a direct relationship is established between the User and the Agent, to which Last is not a party, merely providing the APP so that the Parties may communicate and place any orders they require. Therefore, Last shall never be liable for either the availability of Agents or the proper and satisfactory performance of the requested tasks by them.',
    'terms.no_warranty.paragraph2' => 'Last does not confirm, validate or verify any Agent, their identity or their background. Notwithstanding the above, Last may, from time to time, carry out additional checks and implement procedures designed to help verify or confirm the identity of Agents. In this regard, when a User obtains Agent status, this merely indicates that the User has completed the relevant registration process and has accepted these General Terms of Use together with any other specific terms that may apply. It does not constitute any certification, endorsement or guarantee by Last as to the Agent’s reliability, suitability and/or trustworthiness.',
    'terms.no_warranty.paragraph3' => 'Accordingly, Last recommends that Customers always exercise common sense and due care when entrusting a task to a particular Agent.',
    'terms.no_warranty.paragraph4' => 'By becoming members of the Platform, Users agree that any legal liability they seek to pursue as a result of the acts or omissions of other Users of the Platform or third parties shall be limited to those Users or third parties, and that no claim for liability may be brought against Last.',

    // ── Section 17 ────────
    'terms.platform_updates.title' => '17. Platform Updates and Modifications',
    'terms.platform_updates.paragraph1' => 'Last reserves the right to amend these General Terms of Use, the Privacy Policy and the Cookie Policy at any time and without prior notice. Users must read these General Terms of Use carefully each time they access the Platform. In all cases, acceptance of the General Terms of Use shall be a prior and indispensable requirement for accessing the services and content available through the Lastapp Platform.',
    'terms.platform_updates.paragraph2' => 'Likewise, Last reserves the right, at any time and without prior notice, to update, modify or remove the information contained on its Platform, as well as its configuration, presentation and access conditions, without assuming any liability in this regard. Last does not guarantee that access to the Platform or its content will be uninterrupted or error-free, nor that it will always be up to date. However, whenever there are no circumstances that make it impossible or excessively difficult to do so, and as soon as Last becomes aware of any errors, interruptions or outdated content, it shall make every reasonable effort to correct such errors, restore access and update the content.',

    // ── Section 18 ────────
    'terms.intellectual_property.title' => '18. Intellectual Property',
    'terms.intellectual_property.paragraph1' => 'Last is the owner or licensee of all intellectual and industrial property rights relating to the Platform, as well as the content accessible through it. The intellectual property rights in the Platform, including its texts, images, graphic design, navigation structure, information and content, are owned by Last, which holds the exclusive right to exploit them in any form and, in particular, the rights of reproduction, distribution, public communication and transformation, in accordance with Spanish intellectual and industrial property legislation.',
    'terms.intellectual_property.paragraph2' => 'Notwithstanding the foregoing, Last may not own or hold licences for certain content, such as names or images of companies with which Last has no commercial relationship. In such cases, Last obtains such content from publicly accessible sources, and under no circumstances shall this be understood as meaning that Last holds any ownership rights over such content.',
    'terms.intellectual_property.paragraph3' => 'Authorisation granted to the User to access the Platform shall not constitute any waiver, transfer, licence or assignment, whether in whole or in part, of Last’s intellectual or industrial property rights. It is prohibited to remove, circumvent or manipulate in any way the content available on Last’s Platform. Likewise, it is prohibited to modify, copy, reuse, exploit, reproduce, publicly communicate, republish, upload, send by email, transmit, use, process or distribute, in any form, all or part of the content included on Last’s Platform for public or commercial purposes without the prior express written authorisation of Last or, where applicable, the relevant rights holder.',
    'terms.intellectual_property.paragraph4' => 'Any User who shares any type of content through the Platform warrants that they hold the necessary rights to do so, and Last shall not be liable for the content or the legality of the information provided. The provision of content by Users through the Platform shall constitute the assignment to Last, free of charge and to the fullest extent permitted under applicable law, of the intellectual and industrial property exploitation rights arising from such content.',

    // ── Section 19 ────────
    'terms.severability.title' => '19. Severability',
    'terms.severability.paragraph1' => 'If any provision of these General Terms of Use is held to be null and void or voidable, it shall be deemed not to have been included. Such declaration of invalidity shall not affect the validity of the remaining provisions of the Agreement, which shall remain in full force and effect between the Parties.',

    // ── Section 20 ────────
    'terms.applicable_law.title' => '20. Applicable Law',
    'terms.applicable_law.paragraph1' => 'The relationship between Last and the User shall be governed by and construed in accordance with these General Terms of Use which, with regard to their interpretation, validity and performance, shall be governed by Spanish law. Any dispute shall be submitted to the Courts of Barcelona, unless the User chooses to bring proceedings before the courts of their place of residence.',

    // ── Section 21 ────────
    'terms.dispute_resolution.title' => '21. Extrajudicial Dispute Resolution',
    'terms.dispute_resolution.paragraph1' => 'Any disputes or controversies arising outside the European Union shall be subject to resolution by the Spanish Court of Arbitration of the Chamber of Commerce.',


    // ── FAQ Page ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    'faq.title' => 'Frequently Asked Questions',
    'faq.desc' => 'Answers to the most common questions about our food, home delivery, and rotisserie chicken orders in Torredembarra.',
    'faq.items' => [
        [
            'q' => 'What does the rotisserie chicken include and what menu options are available?',
            'a' => 'Our rotisserie chicken (pollo a l\'ast) is served whole or half, always accompanied by our homemade aioli. We offer combo menus with homemade French fries, salads (Caesar, mixed, Russian salad), roasted meat cannelloni, or croquettes. You can view updated options and prices in our online menu.',
        ],
        [
            'q' => 'Where does your chicken come from and what quality guarantees do you offer?',
            'a' => 'We work with the "Pollastre Groc Català" certification from Alimentbarna (cereal-fed chicken raised in Catalonia). Our supplier holds ISO 9001 and ISO 22000 international quality and food safety certifications audited by Bureau Veritas.',
        ],
        [
            'q' => 'Do you offer home delivery and which areas do you cover?',
            'a' => 'Yes, we deliver in Torredembarra and nearby areas such as Altafulla, Creixell, La Móra, La Pobla de Montornès, and La Nou de Gaià. Estimated delivery time is 35 to 45 minutes, and delivery fees are calculated automatically during online checkout.',
        ],
        [
            'q' => 'Do you have a weekday takeaway menu?',
            'a' => 'Yes, from Monday to Friday we offer an affordable takeaway menu featuring 2 dishes to choose from (Russian salad, pasta bolognese, croquettes, roasted chicken, etc.) plus a drink.',
        ],
        [
            'q' => 'What other prepared dishes do you offer and how can I order paella or fideuà?',
            'a' => 'Besides rotisserie chicken, we prepare BBQ wings, roasted meat cannelloni, stuffed aubergines, homemade croquettes, and salads. We also make seafood paella, black rice, and fideuà for groups, available upon advance order with at least 24 hours notice.',
        ],
        [
            'q' => 'Do you offer options for allergies, celiacs, or vegetarian diets?',
            'a' => 'Our traditional rotisserie chicken marinade is gluten-free. We also offer vegetarian side dishes (salads, potatoes). Please inform us of any allergies or celiac condition so we can take extra precautions against cross-contamination.',
        ],
        [
